message: "If you use this software or its structured research artifacts, please cite this repository."
title: "CSRP Paper-as-Skill: A provenance-preserving architecture for institutional scientific AI"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-08
authors:
  - family-names: "Guan"
    given-names: "Jiahao"
repository-code: "https://github.com/turboguan/csrp-paper-skills"
url: "https://github.com/turboguan/csrp-paper-skills"
abstract: >-
  A research prototype that represents scientific papers as shared, structured,
  provenance-preserving skills and reserves persistent agency for a small number
  of domain-level reasoning roles. The repository includes deterministic
  demonstrations, real-paper structured records, an evidence graph, an Evidence
  Judge, and a Safety Supervisor for high-risk scientific evidence synthesis.
keywords:
  - scientific AI
  - paper-as-skill
  - evidence synthesis
  - provenance
  - multi-agent systems
  - suicide prevention
